<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Tasks Available</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333">
    <h2>Hi <%= userName %>,</h2>

    <p>
      The registration phase for En-Passant Recruitment 2026 has officially
      concluded, and your tasks are now available!
    </p>

    <p>
      You can view your assigned tasks, instructions, and upload your
      submissions by visiting your dashboard:
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        href="<%= dashboardUrl %>"
        style="
          display: inline-block;
          padding: 10px 20px;
          background-color: #111;
          color: #ffffff;
          text-decoration: none;
          border-radius: 5px;
        "
        >Go to Dashboard</a
      >
    </p>

    <p>
      If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or use the
      contact form on our website.
    </p>

    <p>Best regards,<br />The En-Passant Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
